  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kerala Rural Water Supply and Environmental Sanitation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall project development objective is to assist GOK in improving the quality of rural water supply and environmental sanitation service delivery to achieve sustainability of investments. Specific development objectives are to: (a) demonstrate the viability of cost recovery and institutional reforms by developingcomma testing and implementing the new decentralized service delivery model on a pilot basiscomma and (b) build the state&apos;s capacity in improved sector management in order to scale up the new decentralized service delivery modelcomma statewide.</narrative>
  </description>
